          ],
          "correctOptionId": "4",
          "marks": 1,
          "negativeMarks": 0.25,
          "explanation": "<p>Eight persons:&nbsp;P, Q, R, S, T, U, V and W</p>\n\n<p>1. R sits third to the right of P, who is immediate left of T, who faces away from the center.</p>\n\n<p>So, P faces towards or away from the center.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Kanchan.A_12-05_21_Savita_D12.png\" style=\"width: 197px; height: 251px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Kanchan.A_12-05_21_Savita_D13.png\" style=\"width: 216px; height: 236px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>2. U sits immediate right of V and both face towards the center.</p>\n\n<p>3. R does not face towards the center.</p>\n\n<p>4. S sits opposite to Q, who is not adjacent to W.</p>\n\n<p>As, R does not face towards the center, so, case 2 would be rejected.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F1_Kanchan.A_12-05_21_Savita_D14.png\" style=\"width: 221px; height: 237px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hence, two persons sit between Q and R when counted from left of R.</p>",
